# 15. Fargate Architecture

```text id="5zq2np"
Kubernetes Pod

        |

Fargate Profile

        |

AWS Managed Compute
```

---

# 16. Fargate Benefits

Advantages:

* No node management
* Automatic scaling
* Strong isolation

---

Good for:

* Small applications
* APIs
* Batch jobs
* Serverless workloads

---

# 17. Fargate Limitations

Not ideal for:

* DaemonSets
* GPU workloads
* High-performance computing
* Custom node requirements

