# 18. Spot Instances in EKS

Spot Instances use unused AWS capacity at lower cost.

Example:

On-Demand:

```text id="m4w0qz"
$100/month
```

Spot:

```text id="e4p2z9"
$30/month
```

---

# 19. Spot Instance Architecture

Recommended:

```text id="9h8m4x"
Production Workloads

        |

On-Demand Nodes


Batch Workloads

        |

Spot Nodes
```

---

# 20. Spot Instance Best Practices

Use for:

* Stateless applications
* Batch processing
* CI/CD runners

Avoid for:

* Critical databases
* Single-instance workloads

